{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-heisenberg-commutator","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:heisenberg-commutator","kind":"proposition","title":"$q$-deformed Heisenberg commutator from the Reeb fibre","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-q-deformed-commutator","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-quantum-planck-constant"],"tags":["heisenberg","uncertainty","reeb","commutator"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.ArchimedeanUniverse.heisenberg_commutator","text":"heisenberg-commutator-prop.md","leanSource":"heisenberg-commutator-prop.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:heisenberg-commutator\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[\\hat{X}, \\hat{P}]_q = J\\hbar_q(p)</code> be the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-deformed commutator of the fibre observables <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hat{X}, \\hat{P}</code> on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{P}^1(\\mathbb{C})</code>. The commutator interpolates between the classical and maximally-uncertain regimes:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>As <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\to 1</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[\\hat{X}, \\hat{P}]_q \\to 0</code> (classical limit, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hbar_q \\to 0</code>).</li>\n<li>As <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\to \\infty</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[\\hat{X}, \\hat{P}]_q \\to J</code> (maximal uncertainty, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hbar_q \\to 1</code>).</li>\n</ol>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/heisenberg-commutator-prop.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"4.9.2","page":"b/prop-heisenberg-commutator","qa":{"counts":{"pass":88,"fail":2,"warn":2,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":80},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.MassTheory.heisenberg_commutator","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/heisenberg-commutator-prop.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
